From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bhargav <BJP232004@GMAIL.COM>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 13:07:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(openobserve): W3C trace context support

- 128-bit UUIDv7-shaped trace identifiers (inline generation, no new
  dependency), span identifiers unchanged
- reuse an existing valid traceparent header on the request instead of
  starting a new trace; injected tracing headers replace pre-existing
  ones instead of appending duplicates
- 'openobserve' accepted as an alias of the 'datadog' propagator type
- default propagators reduced to ['tracecontext']
- trace/span ids serialized as hex in resource tracing info

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
